WEBVTT

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:05.100
What manner of cartography is this?

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.600
Steady, don't burn now.

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:20.600
Watch your step, little fox.
The ink is still wet.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:23.800
Curious, isn't it?

00:01:04.840 --> 00:01:07.250
Just one final stitch to bind them all.

00:01:07.850 --> 00:01:10.200
The blueprint is complete and powerful.

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:30.850
Every path is a memory written in light.

00:01:30.950 --> 00:01:33.150
Wait for the silent glow to guide you home.

00:01:33.650 --> 00:01:35.100
Look closely at the dark.

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:38.100
The trail ends here.

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:41.150
What secrets lie below?

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:48.250
I tucked the unfinished fifth draft
into the lower drawer to keep the studio safe.
